subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Bulk operations on subscriptions

USAGE:
  subtrack [COMMANDS] <OPTIONS>

COMMANDS:
  [bulk] <OPTIONS>         Bulk operations on subscriptions
  delete <OPTIONS>         Bulk delete subscriptions
  status <OPTIONS>         Bulk change subscription status
  tag <OPTIONS>            Bulk add/remove tags

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  subtrack bulk --help
  subtrack bulk delete --help
  subtrack bulk status --help
  subtrack bulk tag --help

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help             Display this help message
  -v, --version          Display this version

